# English -- a line whose placeholders differ is ignored on the device and the
# English is shown. Mesh terms that are names (LongFast, MQTT, LoRa) stay as they
# are. Lines are kept sorted by the English, for review; the build sorts anyway.
# First draft: review by a native speaker welcome (see docs/TRANSLATING.md).
#
